{"id":152432718,"slug":"live-online-classes-about-navigating","title":"Live Online Classes About Navigating Insurance ","subtitle":"Two upcoming classes for Mental Health Professionals ","post_date":"2024-12-02T14:35:36.263Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/live-online-classes-about-navigating","wordcount":253,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:50:18.120Z","body_sha256":"d6cc069ac481b57c549836ceb7f5615762f5c67f8f07a9afcda4291ab1fbfd6c","text_words":251,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p>The Frontier Psychiatrists newsletter exists, in large part, because Kari Groff, M.D. encouraged me to keep writing.  She created an online community of mental health professionals called the Brooklyn and Beyond Mental Health Group.</p><p>Because she asked, the following classes are coming up!  Join us.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!H2Gb!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbfe0bc43-9848-4834-a932-26e170289982_4032x3024.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!H2Gb!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbfe0bc43-9848-4834-a932-26e170289982_4032x3024.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!H2Gb!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbfe0bc43-9848-4834-a932-26e170289982_4032x3024.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!H2Gb!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbfe0bc43-9848-4834-a932-26e170289982_4032x3024.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!H2Gb!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbfe0bc43-9848-4834-a932-26e170289982_4032x3024.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!H2Gb!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbfe0bc43-9848-4834-a932-26e170289982_4032x3024.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"1092\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/bfe0bc43-9848-4834-a932-26e170289982_4032x3024.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1092,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:1570694,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!H2Gb!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbfe0bc43-9848-4834-a932-26e170289982_4032x3024.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!H2Gb!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbfe0bc43-9848-4834-a932-26e170289982_4032x3024.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!H2Gb!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbfe0bc43-9848-4834-a932-26e170289982_4032x3024.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!H2Gb!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fbfe0bc43-9848-4834-a932-26e170289982_4032x3024.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><h4>Class 1: Introduction to American Health Insurance</h4><p><strong>When:</strong> Wednesday, Dec 4th at 11 a.m.<br><strong>What you'll learn:</strong> A deep dive into the history of the American health insurance system, including premiums, co-pays, deductibles, and what it means to go out-of-network. This is a great introduction to what many of us don't probably know about the health insurance system in America and how complicated it all gets! Have you ever looked at your own bill for care? This class will help break things down in a way that is comprehensible. <br><a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/health-insurance-in-america-pt-1-tickets-1080705000749?aff=oddtdtcreator\">Tickets here</a></p><h4>Class 2: Navigating the Out-of-Network (OON) Landscape</h4><p><strong>When:</strong> Monday, Dec 9th at 11 a.m.<br><strong>What you'll learn:</strong> How to navigate reimbursement hurdles, understand good faith estimates, and learn best practices for chart sharing and client transparency. This is a great class if you are already OON and want to make sure you are doing things by the book or if you are thinking about making the leap off of panels<br><a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/health-insurance-in-america-pt2-tickets-1080742101719?aff=oddtdtcreator\">Tickets here</a></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>If these are popular, feel free to request more, on whatever topics make sense to you? </p><p>Maybe I'll make it a regular thing!  And now, more photos of Brooklyn by your author…</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3H2w!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F089a5159-48c8-437c-977e-8658285d3a03_4032x3024.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!3H2w!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_pro